		(uuid "6efbd84b-90ed-4b42-922a-318ae4574910")
	)
	(text "Set S2 to \"PROG\" to load Sketch on\nArduino, then set to \"RUN\" for MIDI\ncommunication\nLED1, LED2, RV1, RV2, S3, S4, and S5 are\navailable for application usage."
